sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Seller
    actor Buyer
    participant C as VehicleEscrow<br/>(smart contract)
    participant STO as Certified STO node
    participant Reg as Registrar node

    Seller->>C: createDeal(vinHash, price, duration)
    C-->>Seller: dealId (status: Created)
    Buyer->>C: lockPayment(dealId) + 100% of price
    Note over C: status: Funded, deadline starts
    STO->>C: confirmInspection(dealId, reportHash, passed)
    alt inspection passed
        Note over C: status: Inspected
        Reg->>C: confirmReRegistration(dealId)
        C->>Seller: transfer price (status: Completed)
    else inspection failed
        C->>Buyer: instant refund (status: Refunded)
    else deadline passed without completion
        Buyer->>C: refund(dealId)
        C->>Buyer: refund (status: Refunded)
    end
